      "note": "Returns no_dba_declared when the application sets \"DBA same as legal name\": a sole proprietor with no DBA must never show a clean DBA check that checked nothing. The finding text must not imply the name is registered anywhere — there is no DBA filing in the required set, so this compares what documents display and nothing more.",
